  "content": "<p>2.5D vs. 3D milling; toolpaths; bits; feeds and speeds; fixturing, tabs, and zeroing; materials; CAM workflow; the CNC job with the lab tech.</p><h2>Ideas</h2><p>Subtractive constraints (tool radius, reach, undercuts); the toolpath as drawing at scale; stock, waste, and nesting; relief and topography.</p><h2>In class</h2><ul><li>Lecture (35 min)</li><li>CAM demo (40 min)</li><li>CNC run with the tech (60 min)</li><li>relief exercise starts</li></ul>"
